            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We report a hyperalgic form of an osteoid osteoma of the capitatum, wich had evolved since 14 months. The diagnosis was done by roentgenography. Complete surgical excision of the lesion led to the cure.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
